---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Seamless Gutter Installation Woodbridge, VA" description="Custom seamless aluminum and steel gutter installation in Woodbridge, VA. Proper sizing, color matching, and professional install. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Installation</div>
      <h1>Seamless Gutter Installation in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Custom-fit seamless aluminum and steel systems built for Virginia weather and lasting curb appeal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why Seamless Gutters?</h2>
      <p>Fewer seams mean fewer leak points. We measure on-site, fabricate continuous runs, and install with correct pitch and hangers for the rainfall intensity of Prince William County.</p>
      <h2>What You Get</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Custom sizing and popular color options</li>
        <li>Heavy-gauge aluminum or steel</li>
        <li>Proper downspout placement and discharge</li>
        <li>Fascia protection and clean finish</li>
        <li>Workmanship warranty</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Installation Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
